Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.11,0:00:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（轰隆）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:09.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:14.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:15.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:16.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.85,0:00:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它挡在外面！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:27.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:31.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.21,0:00:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会让你伤害任何一个人！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:44.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·天空拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:44.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:47.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:52.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.98,0:00:52.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色护卫队又打败乱暴兽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:01.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经是第十只了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虚蜢达和暗塌谷帝国 也该吸取教训了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们干得好 英雄们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你们能够团结 保护好蓝天大地的国民
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1245,970)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}超巨大乱暴兽大爆炸!? 守护蓝天大地！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}{\fs50\pos(1320,960)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它本来是性情温顺的野生动物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知为何 突然就开始袭击村里人...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.37,0:03:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须要调查一下呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.08,0:03:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢 感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.61,0:03:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只动物在什么时间段出没？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:23.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（动物奔跑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.79,0:03:25.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:29.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,镇... 镇静 求你停下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那只？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.53,0:03:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 就是那只
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:36.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！你这不懂事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就来帮你！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:41.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,先不要出手 队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.30,0:03:44.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,它只是脚受伤了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:46.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才会生气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:49.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,它不是危险动物 我来制止它
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:52.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你了 不要伤害它！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:53.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看前面！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:55.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（咚）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:02.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.87,0:04:09.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就这点程度 一点都不痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:11.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.13,0:04:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大功一件呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:15.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,丢人啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你帮助了村民们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:19.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:23.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,护卫队要负责各种各样的事情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与袭击都城的危险敌人作战 的确是很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巡逻也是一样重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在边境 有非常多的人需要我们帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.81,0:04:38.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我 那个时候的我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 都很严厉地警告过这丫头 不要靠近那座森林的...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴你别发呆了 快谢谢人家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:56.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:05:00.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,幸运的护身符
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能收下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:03.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.30,0:05:13.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:14.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:20.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天 我便决定要成为英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:25.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那种小碎天空石 随处都可以捡到的 诶嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:25.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(720,965)}Sky Jewel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能与你像现在这样重逢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定也是受到这宝石的指引
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:43.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:57.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样 公主永永远远 幸福地生活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:05:59.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可贺 可喜可贺
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.23,0:06:01.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:04.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 小公主 到午睡的时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.77,0:06:05.92,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:07.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,要午睡的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:09.88,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空 小空 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.19,0:06:12.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 还没有到叛逆期吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.19,0:06:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（敲门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:13.55,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:20.37,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.55,0:06:21.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.39,0:06:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:29.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.05,0:06:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事就好！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:33.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.92,0:06:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 公主殿下！非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鄙人是阿翼的父亲...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:40.37,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你们来做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王陛下通知我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.16,0:06:44.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:48.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 一般都是先回家见父母的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:52.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是骑士 必须陪伴在公主身边！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小翼 就没有脱离叛逆期呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:57.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你还把我当孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:06:59.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,先放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:02.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,要是被谁看见了 那就太丢脸了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:04.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,有时间吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:06.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:10.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 莫非是阿翼的爸爸和妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.21,0:07:11.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,初次见面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:16.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是虹丘真白小姐 我们在那边世界一起生活
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子 一段时间没见 都已经结婚了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:23.44,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.76,0:07:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈... 妈妈觉得 小翼你谈朋友还为时过早了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:30.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了 你们搞错了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:36.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你要回天窗市了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:41.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我打算明天和奶奶通话 让她打开通道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:44.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一来我还得上学
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:46.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我也看到了 即使我不在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:49.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地这里也没什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.37,0:07:54.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 队长 护卫队的队员们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.57,0:07:58.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,还有阿翼 这个世界有你们在保护
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:02.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,只是住在不同的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.95,0:08:05.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,通过通道 随时可以见面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.74,0:08:08.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不会有任何改变 也不会失去什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:12.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可是朋友啊 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.87,0:08:14.26,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:18.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 要保重
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:21.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,睡觉的时候 不能露肚皮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:24.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,刷牙漱口要漱干净
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.22,0:08:28.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不能对阿翼太无理取闹哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:29.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,还有...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:34.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不要忘记我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:36.34,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:42.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好！等晴雯丽巡逻回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:44.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙一起吃一顿大餐吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:46.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 真不错！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（轰隆）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:57.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:04.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:17.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:22.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们认为 我会毫无目的地不断召唤乱暴兽？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:24.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,错了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.61,0:09:30.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,被打倒的乱暴兽 它们的能量会潜伏在这都城
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.51,0:09:35.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因为队长和护卫队是无法净化它们的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:43.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 弱者们竭尽全力的努力 全都白费了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:49.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界 是多么残酷 是多么可悲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去城堡里避难！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:16.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:18.90,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,变得越来越大...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:23.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.38,0:10:28.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,国王陛下！那是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.91,0:10:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:34.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,还中意我的礼物吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:37.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是会在一小时后爆炸的炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:41.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,届时 暗塌谷的黑暗会吞噬蓝天大地的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:47.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 你们要是交出小公主的话 我可以中止倒计时的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:52.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只因我这人心善 给你们一个选择的余地
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.97,0:10:54.04,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:55.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太卑鄙了...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:59.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不会让他得逞的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:01.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.93,0:11:02.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:05.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,他去探查敌情 被攻击了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:07.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,都跟他说过 不能一个人去的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:09.20,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:13.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我没能派上用 呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.35,0:11:17.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.93,0:11:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能用Precure的力量 净化那颗炸弹吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:24.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky和Cure Prism
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们携手施展的最强招数
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.66,0:11:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得是叫做...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:32.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,升流耀光
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.27,0:11:42.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:44.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
