Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.95,0:12:52.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,广阔无限的蓝天！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.53,0:12:54.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.53,0:12:54.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:01.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,辽阔拂远的柔光！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.80,0:13:04.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.80,0:13:04.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}棱镜愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.95,0:13:15.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,比以往的乱暴兽都要来得大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:19.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,升流耀光能够净化干净吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:21.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,即使没保证...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:23.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,只能上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.86,0:13:34.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空蓝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.86,0:13:34.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:39.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,棱镜白！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:39.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism White！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:13:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦！能行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.18,0:14:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 Sky
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:18.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,了不起 这么弱还拼了老命 太了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.49,0:14:19.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,想多了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:26.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:43.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.89,0:14:46.54,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,撑不住了...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.89,0:14:48.35,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:52.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不能！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:53.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不能放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:03.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.33,0:15:16.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能让你们独自背负这场战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.41,0:15:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:29.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是... 队长
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.62,0:15:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人冲上去 太乱来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:33.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,队... 队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.64,0:15:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管对手有多强 都要贯彻正义直到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.27,0:15:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.49,0:15:45.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲过去！长尾鹫！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.19,0:15:58.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.62,0:16:08.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.79,0:16:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.23,0:16:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该英雄亮相了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.91,0:16:33.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
