Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.38,0:16:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.42,0:17:02.56,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:04.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.68,0:17:06.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:11.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,区区弱者 区区弱者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.95,0:17:12.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,虚蜢达
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:17.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,居然敢忤逆我这个强者 不可理喻！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:19.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,混账！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:28.91,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:34.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呼...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:38.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我也真是了 竟然急躁了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:41.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 吓到你了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.40,0:17:43.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 争吵已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.01,0:17:46.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,把小公主交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.22,0:17:48.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做什么梦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不惜性命 也要保护公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.06,0:17:55.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 太遗憾了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.36,0:17:56.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虚蜢蜢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.75,0:18:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.92,0:18:01.63,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.84,0:18:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快...逃...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.07,0:18:05.95,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小...空...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.75,0:18:11.07,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小...空...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:29.09,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:33.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主 跟我一起出去玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.27,0:18:35.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（玻璃破裂声）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.51,0:18:41.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不许动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:47.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你胆敢再靠近小空一丝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:50.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对饶不了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:11.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虚...虚蜢蜢...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.23,0:19:24.88,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.34,0:19:30.02,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪里！飒拉拉队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请回答我们！队长！啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:47.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先去休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:50.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.98,0:19:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长她... 她肯定也以你为荣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:09.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要想办法解除这个 否则他们醒不过来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:11.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,简直就像是诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.61,0:20:14.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,之后该怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:16.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:19.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们回天窗市吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:26.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶... 回去？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.98,0:20:32.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 拜托由由阿姨调查 治疗国王和王妃的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.97,0:20:35.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 虚蜢达在盯着小空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:40.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不能让她一个人留在蓝天大地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.67,0:20:44.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们三个人解散 绝非上策
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.47,0:20:46.80,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.63,0:20:50.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不用担心 Precure是无敌的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:52.92,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.31,0:20:55.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 不要勉强
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:20:59.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我收到队长给我的信了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.25,0:21:01.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.06,0:21:07.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在驾鸟上阵前 她去过我的房间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:09.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,都写了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.61,0:21:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别停下脚步 英雄少女 再会了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.85,0:21:19.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.99,0:21:21.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是施展了“绝对能够重逢”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.03,0:21:24.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这种魔法的吊坠
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.18,0:21:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要服输 晴雯丽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.43,0:21:43.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,去天窗市！我们走！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.55,0:21:48.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,飒拉拉队长
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.62,0:21:54.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我会勇往直前
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:56.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这样 一定就能...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.34,0:21:58.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,能够再次...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:01.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,见到队长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.43,0:22:08.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Lovely哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.43,0:22:08.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1045,960)}可爱愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.94,0:22:10.19,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.36,0:22:13.20,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,注入快乐！充电幸福！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.36,0:22:13.20,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(910,960)}happyness   charge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.26,0:23:48.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主无精打采的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.24,0:23:50.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙一起哄小空笑吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:53.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空都喜欢什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.19,0:23:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就只有那个了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.42,0:23:58.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这个 好有英雄的感觉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.11,0:24:00.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.11,0:24:00.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.79,0:24:03.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,空太郎一行的打鬼记
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.22,0:01:21.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.43,0:01:27.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.23,0:01:32.57,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.57,0:01:40.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:45.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:49.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:51.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.17,0:01:55.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.05,0:02:00.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:02.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:06.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:10.57,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.57,0:02:13.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.59,0:02:13.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:15.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.34,0:02:15.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:21.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:26.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:31.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:36.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:39.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.34,0:02:47.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.04,0:22:29.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空万里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.71,0:22:34.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能实现梦想与心愿的蔚蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.46,0:22:37.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打开心中的麦克风
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.05,0:22:38.88,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.88,0:22:41.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:44.18,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.18,0:22:46.14,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能与你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.14,0:22:48.81,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打开心灵+门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.89,0:22:51.60,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已经激动到势不可挡!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.60,0:22:53.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.40,0:22:55.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:23:02.50,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}还是那条街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.21,0:23:08.33,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那里 这便是奇迹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.33,0:23:10.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.38,0:23:15.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都过来！传开这韵律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.05,0:23:19.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牵起手 心连起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.31,0:23:25.39,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用温暖的关怀 培育出的勇气 是无穷无穷的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:29.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,积极的图标是标记
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.65,0:23:33.82,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！这海阔天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.82,0:23:37.52,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们展开翅膀 飞向蓝天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:38.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,连接起人与人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.91,0:23:41.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圆环！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
